{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53167","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 崔謩","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一叶来自东，路在沧溟中。\n远思日边国，却逐波上国。\n问法言语异，传经文字同。\n何当至本处，定作玄门宗。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔謩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}